# Run artifacts from `dotnet run` — the database bundle, WAL, lock, and the profiler captures. Captures live inside
# the bundle (world-shard.typhon/profilings/), so ignoring the bundle already covers them; the loose patterns stay for
# anything written outside it by an explicit Typhon:Profiler:Trace path.
*.bin
*.wal
*.lock
*.typhon/
*.typhon-trace
